{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Children of Anak.</b> On the father's side." "<b>From the Nephilim.</b> On the mother's side." "<b>And so we were in their eyes.</b> Like grasshoppers or less than that — and on this account they did not rise against us, for they did not regard us as significant, and it was beneath their dignity to do us harm."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:41.919830543Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}